       "source": "PubMed",
       "id": "25605331"
      }
     ],
     "value": "Required for the assembly of the ubiquinol-cytochrome c reductase complex (mitochondrial respiratory chain complex III or cytochrome b-c1 complex), mediating cytochrome b recruitment and probably stabilization within the complex. Thereby, plays an important role in ATP production by mitochondria. Cardiolipin-binding protein, it may also control the cardiolipin composition of mitochondria membranes and their morphology"
    }
   ],
   "commentType": "FUNCTION"
  },
  {
   "texts": [
    {
     "evidences": [
      {
       "evidenceCode": "ECO:0000250",
       "source": "UniProtKB",
       "id": "Q8K2T4"
      },
      {
       "evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269",
       "source": "PubMed",
       "id": "25605331"
      }
     ],
     "value": "Associates with the ubiquinol-cytochrome c reductase complex (mitochondrial respiratory chain complex III or cytochrome b-c1 complex). Interacts with UQCC1. Forms a complex, named COMC, composed of UQCC1, UQCC2; UQCC3 and UQCC4; mediates MT-CYB hemylation and association with the first nuclear-encoded complex III subunit UQCRQ (By similarity)"
    }
   ],
   "commentType": "SUBUNIT"
