    "acronym": "MC3DN9",
    "description": "A form of mitochondrial complex III deficiency, a disorder of the mitochondrial respiratory chain resulting in a highly variable phenotype depending on which tissues are affected. MC3DN9 clinical features include feeding difficulties, hypoglycemia, severe lactic acidosis, and delayed psychomotor development.",
    "diseaseCrossReference": {
